"No more heroes. No more conquerors. No room for even gods to crawl out of the woodwork."

pt:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0240220a07'>
//「英雄がいなけりゃ魔王もいないさ。
//　神様だってきっと這い出してくる隙がない」
"Não haverá mais heróis. Nem conquistadores. Nem mesmo os deuses terão espaço para sair de seus esconderijos."

en:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0240230a07'>
//「だから今のうちにやるんだ、お兄さん」
"That's why it has to be㉓<I>now,</I> brother. This is our final chance."

pt:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0240230a07'>
//「だから今のうちにやるんだ、お兄さん」
"É por isso que tem de ser㉓<I>agora,</I> irmão. Esta é a nossa última chance."

en:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md04/0240240a00'>
//「神を呼ぶ……か」
"To summon a god..."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md04/0240240a00'>
//「神を呼ぶ……か」
"Invocar um deus..."

en:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0240250a07'>
//「古き時代の終わりに。
//　<RUBY text='・・・・・'>最後の神話</RUBY>を創り出す」
"One last myth before the page turns. We'll give 'em a legend to end all legends."

pt:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md04/0240250a07'>
